<title>CHILE: Chile's Enersis 1996 net rises slightly.</title>
<headline>Chile's Enersis 1996 net rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean power investment company Enersis SA posted consolidated net earnings of 105.97 billion pesos, up two percent from 1995, said the firm in a statement.</p>
<p>Profits from the firm's foreign subsidiaries rose to 31 percent of Enersis' total earnings from 14 percent in 1995, it said.</p>
<p>The firm reported operating earnings climbing 245 percent to 325.41 billion pesos mainly as the result of rising sales from its Argentine unit Edesur and Peruvian division Edelnor.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
